# Secrets never leave this machine.
#
# The repository root already ignores `.env`, but a key is not the kind of
# thing to protect in only one place — a second copy of the rule here means a
# reorganised root ignore, or this folder being reused somewhere else, cannot
# quietly start committing it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime state, regenerated on demand.
tts_cache/
yasser_memory.json
last_heard.wav
